# No attribute here may rewrite file contents (text, eol, filter, export-*). Anthropic's plugin
# directory refuses to validate a repository whose exported archive differs from its committed
# files. Files are stored exactly as committed: LF everywhere except *.cmd, which keeps the CRLF
# that cmd.exe needs. CI checks that no other file contains CRLF.
*.cmd -text
*.jar binary
*.png binary
*.gif binary
